This directory is reserved for project-specific private libraries.

PlatformIO automatically discovers libraries placed here.

Third-party libraries are declared in platformio.ini under `lib_deps`
and are downloaded automatically on the first build — no manual installation
needed on any platform (macOS, Windows, Linux).

If you need to vendor a library locally (e.g. for offline builds or custom
patches), place it here as a subdirectory, e.g.:

    lib/
    └── MyCustomLib/
        ├── MyCustomLib.h
        └── MyCustomLib.cpp
